{
    "background_story": "Kartier was a majestic Asian elephant with a distinctive proboscidean feature - his exceptionally long trunk. As a member of a revered elephant herd, Kartier's trunk was not only a symbol of his strength and agility but also a testament to his intelligence and resourcefulness. He used his trunk to expertly pluck the ripest fruits from the treetops and to gently guide his herd through the dense jungle. Kartier's proboscidean gift also allowed him to sense the subtlest changes in his environment, warning his herd of potential dangers and leading them to hidden water sources. As the herd's respected matriarch grew older, Kartier's exceptional abilities made him the natural leader, guiding his family with wisdom and compassion.",
